        "prompt": "Triage this support ticket. Classify it as a question, bug, change request, or escalation; identify the next safe action; and ask one specific question if information is missing.",
        "agentId": "software-teams-support-triage",
        "ticketBudgetUsd": 1
      },
      "notes": "Safe first run: this uses a synthetic redacted payload shaped after NDP-34603. To fetch the real completed ticket in staging, select ClickUp Task as Source; live verification is intentionally deferred until slice 9."
